#passage(("I'll tell you something very, very interesting. The first very interesting point is that 70% of the people who accept Islam are women, because they see the honour that Islam is giving to women. Do you know that women were not allowed to have inheritance or own property in the UK until the 1800s? But Islam gave them the right 1400 years ago, to have the right to have inheritance and to own property. Because, when they see Islam giving honour to women from the beginning, people accept Islam more. From every four people, three women accept Islam.", "People hear a lot of bad things about women in Islam. So, then, women study. And when women study, they realise that, actually, Islam gives them honour; they become Muslim. They're trying to push people away, but people come closer to Islam, because the woman is always protected, always honoured, as a wife, as a daughter. So, the Prophet always encourages to take care of our daughters, to take care of our wives, to take care of our mothers. Because people use and abuse women. There is no woman here in the West except that she has a bad experience with a man. He lied to her, he said \"I love you\", blah blah blah. He does what he wants and he goes to the next one. Islam protects you. Islam says: if he's serious, get married! Show us that you're serious!",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Curious Lady Grills Muslim! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2A4ifgnoA5Q", ((804, "13:24–13:57"), (945, "15:45–16:37"),))
