e working in a medical field or something like that, studying for nine years and working in a hospital and at the same time being able to raise their children. So we have to take everything in a balance when it comes to study. I'm not saying women should not study, I'm not saying women should not work, but I'm talking about the balance, I'm talking about the things that are praiseworthy from an Islamic perspective.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim vs Woke | What Islam Actually Says - Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8tefi4j0jMY", ((474, "7:54–8:28"), (522, "8:42–9:18"), (562, "9:22–9:59"), (617, "10:17–10:39"),))
