#passage(("This kind of claim about the right to drive: they have nothing else to say! First: there's nothing in Islam, the Quran, or Hadith that talks about women driving or not driving. We know driving is a modern invention; the vehicles, the cars, are a modern invention. There's nothing in Islam that teaches you to do it or not to do. \"Oh, so women cannot drive, therefore women are oppressed.\" Of course, that doesn't work. Even if a country doesn't allow women to drive, that doesn't mean that these women are oppressed! How did you make that correlation? Is your idea of freedom now is you're going to drive a car?",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| Asmongold Responds - Women Are Oppressed In Islam? | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sGEADBXUEFo", ((1080, "18:00–18:46"),))
