#passage(("It's really sad that the Christians generally, or people when they come, that's the only thing they talk about, this idea of marriage, and age of marriage. On every other Muslim channel you get the same thing, and the reason is: it is common misconception, that is pushed by people who hate Islam.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Questions Muslim On Young Marriages Then Instantly Regrets It! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zHZPZujQbd8", ((56, "0:56–1:31"),))
