s no idea. No idea. And many parents, I know it's the same thing. You have no clue who your children are friends with. You take them to a non-Muslim school. You live in the West, even if you are living in a Muslim country, and you take them to a school, but you don't know who their friends are. You don't know who their company is. And you have no clue what they're learning.", "So, a young child goes to school, other kids talk to them about Jesus, the teacher talks to them about Jesus, other friends, or their parents are teaching them religion, clearly, because they're telling that to your son. And then your son now has no clue; he's confused: Jesus, not Jesus, God. He has nothing. You have taught your kid nothing. I believe no parent in his right mind, a Muslim parent, is going to send his kid to a non-Muslim school. I don't believe that you'd be in your right mind and you're doing this. We need to start waking up. A lot of the parents, I know, you haven't sat down and took your kid and taught him Islam and its foundations and the religion. You've not done this. Parents have become lazy. And some people, I genuinely believe, I'm being very harsh, I believe shouldn't have kids. If you're not going to take care of these kids, you shouldn't even have kids.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “If You're Doing This, There's A Chance Your Kid Leaves Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r632sKczYqY", ((327, "5:27–6:49"), (409, "6:49–7:37"), (460, "7:40–8:17"), (501, "8:21–9:39"), (579, "9:39–10:26"),))
