ng this blessing from [Allah], and fulfilling the command of the prophet where he says, \"Get married [and] multiply.\" We want that in the end. So you want to start working on these issues. We want to start fixing ourselves. And if you're listening to this and you have some of these issues, start working on yourself. If you do, and make dua to Allah, of course, most importantly, inshallah, Allah will give you a righteous spouse. And inshallah, we will have less of these issues in our communities, if all of us stop contributing towards this. That's how change starts, by making a small impact in the community, bit by bit. May [Allah] give everyone a righteous spouse and reward us all and give us that which is most beneficial.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “The Muslim Marriage Crisis: Causes, Effects & Solutions | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=03ZEqe5zZFo", ((1557, "25:57–26:35"), (1595, "26:35–27:09"), (1636, "27:16–28:05"), (1685, "28:05–29:10"), (1750, "29:10–30:19"), (1819, "30:19–30:57"), (1857, "30:57–31:46"), (1907, "31:47–32:39"), (1959, "32:39–34:17"),))

